    "description": "<b>Video Maker With Music & Photo is a powerful all-in-one HD music video maker & photo slideshow maker & Video Status Maker with music, trendy templates, popular effects, stunning transitions, Animated, text, emoji, background.</b> With simple steps, top video maker with music helps you easily create videos, Vlogs, lyrical video, festival video status, anniversary photo status, Magical Video Status, stylish music video and slideshow.\r\n<b>Photo video maker with music - a video editing app & photo editor can edit pictures and selfie, make collage, create video with photo & music effects, cut videos, merge videos, compress videos, fast & slow motion, filters, stickers, save video without losing quality.</b> Make your own creative vlog, interesting memes and funny videos.\r\nMusic video maker designed for editors, video editing beginners, influencers & vloggers. Download Photo video maker now to create and showoff your Fun Music Videos!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 <b>Top Photo Video Maker</b> \ud83c\udfc6\r\n\u2714 Best music video maker & video editor\r\n\u2714 Exquisite themes and video templates \r\n\u2714 Dozens of high-quality FREE music \r\n\u2714 Various magic effects, transitions, filters\r\n\u2714 Easy to use professional editing tools\r\n\u2714 Powerful Photo editor and slideshow maker\r\n\u2714 FREE 100% & No Watermark! \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 <b>Music Video Maker with Templates</b> \r\n* <b>Tons of unique themes:</b>  Beat, attitude, family, love, birthday, holiday, wedding, Christmas etc.\r\n* <b>Trendy music:</b> Fully licensed music, Vlog music, Extract audio from video, Edit with your music\r\n* <b>Full HD video:</b> Only takes one tap to create an awesome music video \r\n* <b>Custom quality:</b> 480-1080P(2k/4k) HD export with no quality loss and no duration limit\r\n* <b>Adjust ratio:</b> Change aspect ratios fit for all media such as 1:1, 16:9, 9:16 etc.\r\n* <b>Easy sharing:</b> share videos on Facebook, YouTube, Instagram, Tik Tok, etc.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc96 <b>Advanced Video Maker & Editor, Music, Effects</b>\r\n- <b>Create with ease:</b> Choose photos.Add music. Set effects, time. Save videos, slideshows and share them with friends.\r\n- <b>Transition effects:</b> The distinctive transition follows the exact music rhythm.\r\n- <b>Amazing effects:</b> Make your photos come alive. Video Status Maker with dynamic Beat Effect, different particles video effects, Glitch effect.\r\n- <b>Exquisite templates:</b> automatically add tempos, beats and stickers that fit the lyrics and make your video cooler than ever.\r\n- <b>Edit photo:</b> Crop/splice/reverse/rotate/trim/split/duplicate your clips. Adjust video brightness, contrast, saturatio.\r\n- <b>Stylish Text, stickers, filters:</b> animated stickers and emoji, background patterns, film inspired filters . Aesthetics, doodle, birthdays, neon.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f <b>Powerful Video Editor & Video Cutter</b>\r\n- <b>Trim video:</b> Cut & trim video as you want. Split video in timeline. Edit video with music\r\n- <b>Merge video:</b> Merge multiple clips into one\r\n- <b>Compress video:</b> Combine and compress video. Advanced technology to save more than 90% size without losing much quality.\r\n- <b>Zoom in or out:</b> Let your audience focus on the region you want\r\n- <b>Speed Control:</b> Fast/slow motion feature.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude80 <b>Professional Photo Editor & Collage</b>\r\n- Edit image with photo editing tool, crop, cutout, rotate, photos\r\n- Add film inspired filters and magic glitch effects\r\n- Variety of text styles and fonts, Gif export, Doodle\r\n- Collage maker, Merge multi photos into one\r\n\r\nTop music movie maker and HD video slideshow maker, photo slideshow maker with music, helps you easily add music to video, edit video with music and pictures for Facebook, Instagram, YouTube, Whatsapp, Musical.ly, TikTok etc. \r\nCome and Download this fantastic Video Maker of Photos with Music! You can share your videos to social media to get more likes and get new followers! \ud83c\udf8a\ud83c\udf89",
